---
description: >-
  A 3-item bar chart with labelRotation set to 120 — above the allowed
  range, checking that the renderer clamps back to a normal (0°)
  rotation instead of applying the out-of-range value. Companion to
  label-rotation-clamped-below-limit.mmd.
config:
  xyChart:
    xAxis:
      showLabel: true
      labelRotation: 120
---
xychart
  title "Items Sold"
  x-axis "Item" [ Monitor, Mouse, Keyboard ]
  y-axis "Number of Sales"
  bar    [ 51, 72, 36 ]
